#!/usr/bin/env python3
# Expose the Grafana and Prometheus that already run on this Kubernetes cluster
# (part of the HKS cluster layout) via a NodePort, and print working links.
# Creates two small Service objects if they do not already exist; never
# touches the existing Grafana/Prometheus deployments or their own Services.
#
# Nothing here is a fixed value for one appliance or one cluster - same
# dynamic cluster/master lookup as the other tasks.

